{"source": "audio/tools/align_voices.py (temp TTS takes, see audio/voice/takes.md)", "lines": [{"id": "N01", "who": "narrator", "in": 4, "out": 106, "text": "Your neighbor thinks your doorbell camera is his podcast studio.", "take": 1, "match": 1.0, "stretch": 1.0}, {"id": "H01", "who": "host", "in": 120, "out": 204, "text": "Welcome back. Episode forty-six.", "take": 0, "match": 1.0, "stretch": 1.0}, {"id": "N02", "who": "narrator", "in": 212, "out": 324, "text": "No camera, no show. So destroy the doorbell camera!", "take": 1, "match": 1.0, "stretch": 1.0}, {"id": "N03", "who": "narrator", "in": 368, "out": 427, "text": "And that night, he's on the baby monitor.", "take": 0, "match": 1.0, "stretch": 1.0}, {"id": "H02", "who": "host", "in": 435, "out": 507, "text": "Tonight's guest just learned to stand.", "take": 1, "match": 1.0, "stretch": 1.0}, {"id": "N04", "who": "narrator", "in": 587, "out": 695, "text": "This needs to stop. So you lock every camera in the house in a safe.", "take": 0, "match": 1.0, "stretch": 1.0}, {"id": "N05", "who": "narrator", "in": 737, "out": 796, "text": "His next guest is a locksmith.", "take": 1, "match": 1.0, "stretch": 1.0}, {"id": "H03", "who": "host", "in": 810, "out": 851, "text": "So how'd you get into this?", "take": 1, "match": 1.0, "stretch": 1.0}, {"id": "N06", "who": "narrator", "in": 902, "out": 1027, "text": "So you sell the house and move so deep into the woods the road gives up before you get there.", "take": 1, "match": 1.0, "stretch": 1.0}, {"id": "N07", "who": "narrator", "in": 1097, "out": 1172, "text": "Three weeks. You haven't heard his voice once.", "take": 0, "match": 1.0, "stretch": 1.065}, {"id": "H04", "who": "host", "in": 1201, "out": 1230, "text": "Welcome back.", "take": 0, "match": 1.0, "stretch": 1.0}, {"id": "H05", "who": "host", "in": 1320, "out": 1421, "text": "So when did you know it was time to move out of your parents' cave?", "take": 0, "match": 1.0, "stretch": 1.0}], "hostEnv": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 